5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom, ensuring we learn from the past to build a sustainable future.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I hope we can find something that... that actually fits our budget. I'll be a bit cautious.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! Let's pick something super cool that actually works when we try to use it!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should focus on the actual friction points in our daily operations. I prefer a rational analysis of the current losses.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Ryuji. We need to be logical. My main concern is the actual capacity of the people who will have to implement this.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,A balanced view is best. I shall look into the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I'll check the capital budget and software allowance, and maybe the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I want to see the network coverage at customer plants and the handling of vendor queries! I bet there are some mysteries there!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I shall investigate the in-house developer availability and the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a comprehensive spread of interests. I believe this will provide the clarity we need.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,This is going to be great! I can't wait to see what we find!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,The data will speak for itself.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let us proceed to the investigation phase.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
